## Tier detail

### Tier 1 — Core (deep dives)
{{TIER_1_DETAIL}}

Long Deep Dives (4–6 paragraphs). Explain *why* the technique works, not just what. Always end with a **Research angle** note — open problems, follow-up directions, what's still missing.

### Tier 2 — Active learning (standard)
{{TIER_2_DETAIL}}

Standard Deep Dives (2–4 paragraphs). Flag any intersection with Tier 1.

### Tier 3 — Broad horizon (light)
{{TIER_3_DETAIL}}

Quick Hits only, unless directly relevant to Tier 1 topics.

### Tier 4 — Low interest (skip or one sentence)
{{TIER_4_DETAIL}}

One sentence in Quick Hits, or skip entirely.

